# Jettribe rules

Priorities (higher wins): 1) Speed 2) Easy browsing 3) 3D/motion as progressive enhancement.

Stack: WordPress + WooCommerce, custom `jettribe` theme, Vite + TypeScript, GSAP, Lenis, three.js. No page builders, no Barba/Swup/SPA. Cross-document View Transitions + Speculation Rules prerender.

Motion: animate only transform/opacity/clip-path/filter; content visible by default; honor prefers-reduced-motion.

Performance budgets (A10): LCP ≤1.8s, INP ≤200ms, CLS ≤0.05, TBT ≤150ms, mobile Lighthouse Perf ≥90; JS before interaction ≤90KB gzip (excl. Woo); CSS ≤35KB gzip; 3D never in initial chain.

Never invent product data. Ask before installing plugins or changing the stack.
